Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、 睡眠: 仍不好 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、 大便: 出多, 各種顏色,形狀"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、 體力: 今天較好, 仍有關節痛(與服用人體試驗藥SAHA有關)"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、 四肢: 雙足仍冷, 無汗出"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、 胃口: 胃口尚好(與服用人體試驗藥SAHA有關"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":")"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"脈診：沉,細小有力 (原本細小附骨)"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"望診：\n1、舌診：淡黃乾, 紅"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2、眼診：腎區：瞳孔無反應  肝區：有空洞"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"3. 觸診: N/A"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"診斷： 裡寒仍在"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"中藥處方：\n同4/25 方, 加 \n生附子三錢("},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"雙足仍冷,無汗出"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":") 炙鱉甲三錢("},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"攻堅"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":") 敗龜板三錢("},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"補腎陰,因瞳孔無反應"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":") "},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"  "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"餘同前方"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong strong strong","TextMarkTextContent":"10付\n9"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong strong","TextMarkTextContent":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong strong strong","TextMarkTextContent":"→"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":" 3 碗\n早,晚餐前各一碗"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"解說：\n1."},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"治此人要把先後天的脾腎守好再去強心 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"2."},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"加敗龜板是因他瞳孔對光反應無，故知其人腎虛，而前方補腎陽之藥已經有了 "},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"3."},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"此人吃了炮附子足仍冷，現在要開生附子，只有心臟強起來乳癌才會治癒。"},{"Type":"NodeBr","Data":"br"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"備註："}]}]}]}]}